{"id":1159,"slug":"stellar-reception-for-advantage-data-vision-at-london-tech-week-2025","path":"/stellar-reception-for-advantage-data-vision-at-london-tech-week-2025","date":"2025-06-18","title":"Stellar Reception for ADVANTAGE DATA VISION at London Tech Week 2025","excerpt":"London, UK — June 2025 — ADVANTAGE …","html":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">London, UK — June 2025 — ADVANTAGE DATA VISION, an innovative health-tech start-up incubated at The Hong Kong Polytechnic University, is delighted to report an exceptional showing at this year’s London Tech Week.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From the moment the exhibition hall opened, our booth drew a constant stream of visitors—entrepreneurs, researchers, investors, and corporate partners—eager to learn how our AI-driven solutions are transforming personalised decision-making in healthcare. By the end of the week, our team had logged hundreds of detailed enquiries, scheduled multiple follow-up demonstrations, and initiated several promising partnership discussions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">“The enthusiasm around our platform exceeded even our highest expectations,” said Lawrence Chan. “London Tech Week has proven again that the city is a global hub for technology and innovation. We’re excited to build on the connections made here and accelerate our international growth.”</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We extend our sincere thanks to the event organisers and every attendee who stopped by. Your questions and feedback inspire us to keep pushing the boundaries of AI-powered healthcare.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/assets/042-lzy01656-1024x683.webp\" alt=\"Stellar Reception for ADVANTAGE DATA VISION at London Tech Week 2025 supporting image 1\" class=\"wp-image-1161\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\">